WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:11.880
It's not just about puffing it up — we use three key techniques for volume that actually holds.

2
00:00:12.216 --> 00:00:23.088
· Direct iron technique: fine zigzag texture is set at the roots so the strands support each other, building a base that keeps volume from collapsing.

3
00:00:23.424 --> 00:00:33.072
· Precise backcombing: also known as teasing, each strand is combed carefully to build dense inner volume.

4
00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:46.176
· Half air, half hair: smooth on the outside but softly lifted with air underneath — this styling avoids an aged look and creates natural fullness.
